            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for a downpour, then the Kannada for to get soaked."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಹಿಂಗಾರು",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಿಂಗಾರು — hiṅgāru — \"the late monsoon; the retreating rains\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಿಂಗಾರು ಮಳೆ ಮುಂಗಾರಿನ ನಂತರ ಬರುತ್ತದೆ. hiṅgāru maḷe muṅgārina nantara baruttade. The late monsoon rain comes after the early monsoon."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Its partner is ಮುಂಗಾರು, the early rains."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಿಂಗಾರು (hiṅgāru) is a native Kannada compound of pin, him, \"behind, later\" (DEDR 4205), and kār, \"the rainy season\" (DEDR 1278)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
