              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆಲಿಕಲ್ಲು (ālikallu) is native Dravidian: DEDR 384 lists Kannada āli-kal, āle-kallu, \"a hailstone\", built with ಕಲ್ಲು, \"a stone\" (DEDR 1298)."
